{
  "$schema": "https://www.designtokens.org/schema/2025.10/tokens.json",
  "$description": "Kiso design tokens — DTCG 2025.10. color.* is the primitive palette, semantic.* is the 15 published colour roles (emitted as --color-<role>), and the remaining groups are the non-colour scales: font, type (size/weight/line-height/letter-spacing on a minor-third modular scale), spacing, radius, shadow, motion, breakpoint. Dark is the default $value; light (\"sand\") lives in $extensions.mode.light. Components consume semantic.* and the scale tokens only.",
